;s 5 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 that pair ran 37% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far March to April sits at 40%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, and grid 15787 came in at 55% that year.</p>"}
